 'description': "When Charlie moved with her family to England, she didn't "
                'expect to become "new meat."\n'
                '\n'
                ' \n'
                '\n'
                "But she did, and she doesn't like it.\n"
                '\n'
                ' \n'
                '\n'
                'The boys in the gang One Direction want her, and Charlie '
                'unknowingly gets herself associated with them, which means '
                "she's a target for other gangs.\n"
                '\n'
                ' \n'
                '\n'
                'Charlie wants out, even though she was never really in.  But '
                "the boys won't let her go that easily.  As much as Charlie "
                'tries to stay away, the boys try even harder to get her '
                'back.  \n'
                '\n'
                ' \n'
                '\n'
                'Which only causes more trouble.\n'
